{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-37464","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-58790","text":"Law Ratification — 2026-07-22"}]},{"id":"blk-37465","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-58791","text":"Additive, permanent record of an architect ruling on the TRVM constitution. This file is the "},{"id":"spn-58792","marks":["bold"],"text":"canonical provenance"},{"id":"spn-58793","text":" for the ratifications below. It does not edit, rename, or re-cite any frozen historical battery ("},{"id":"spn-58794","marks":["code"],"text":"binding_run*.py"},{"id":"spn-58795","text":", "},{"id":"spn-58796","marks":["code"],"text":"fixture.py"},{"id":"spn-58797","text":", "},{"id":"spn-58798","marks":["code"],"text":"compiler.py"},{"id":"spn-58799","text":"). It updates only the governance index "},{"id":"spn-58800","marks":["code"],"text":"LAWS.md"},{"id":"spn-58801","text":" and the additive checker "},{"id":"spn-58802","marks":["code"],"text":"tools/laws_check.py"},{"id":"spn-58803","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-37466","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-58804","text":"Where a law is promoted to Tier A here, its provenance is "},{"id":"spn-58805","marks":["bold"],"text":"this ruling"},{"id":"spn-58806","text":", not a fabricated historical quote. The surviving citations are the "},{"id":"spn-58807","marks":["italic"],"text":"witnesses"},{"id":"spn-58808","text":" that earned the invariant; this ruling is the canonical "},{"id":"spn-58809","marks":["italic"],"text":"statement"},{"id":"spn-58810","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-37467","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-58811","text":"Ratified to Tier A (CANONICAL)"}]},{"id":"blk-37468","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-58812","text":"Law 4 — ratified"}]},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-37470","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-58813","marks":["bold"],"text":"Law 4 — Every reported reduction cost must name the reduction strategy under which it was measured."}]}],"id":"blk-37469","kind":"quote"},{"id":"blk-